Upon termination, you must cease any use no longer authorized under this Agreement and delete any Hi3D model weights and other Hi3D Materials in your possession or control that are required to be deleted. Records required by law and routine backups that cannot be immediately purged must not be used and must be deleted in accordance with the applicable retention period. Termination does not automatically terminate licenses lawfully granted before termination where downstream recipients remain compliant, but you may make no new distributions. Sections 1 and 7 through 16, and accrued rights, survive to the extent applicable.

