This Schedule identifies the assets in this release that are subject to the Hi3D Open License Agreement Version 1.0. The second-stage inference code, documentation and configuration listed below as "Included," together with the eight second-stage model files identified below for distribution under the name Hi3D v1.0 in the Hugging Face model repository at https://huggingface.co/hi3d-official/Hi3Dv1.0, are included under this Agreement to the extent the Licensor owns or is authorized to license them. Inclusion is not affected by the code and weights being stored separately on GitHub and Hugging Face. No third-party model, external dependency, unreleased first-stage material or file listed as "Excluded" is licensed under this Agreement.

