| Second-Stage Inference Code and Architecture (Included) | Under sparc3d/: models/, nn/, ops/, pipelines/, schedulers/, sparcubes/, structures/, utils/ and package initialization files; demo/refine_mesh.py, demo/image_to_mesh.py and demo/coarse_stage.py. Coverage is limited to implementations and modifications that the Licensor is authorized to license. coarse_stage.py is sample adapter code that calls an external Hunyuan model and does not include the Hunyuan code or weights. |
| Second-Stage Model Weights and Configuration (Included) | The following eight Hi3D v1.0 files are included under this Agreement at paths relative to the root of the Hugging Face model repository: model_index.json; scheduler/scheduler_config.json; transformer_512/config.json; transformer_512/model.safetensors (3,675,679,280 bytes); transformer_1024/config.json; transformer_1024/model.safetensors (3,675,679,280 bytes); vae/config.json; and vae/model.safetensors (376,629,712 bytes). transformer_1024/model.safetensors is used for both the 1024³ and 1536³ settings; there is no separate transformer_1536 weight in this release. The designated release location for these files is https://huggingface.co/hi3d-official/Hi3Dv1.0. This item excludes all other files in that repository and also excludes external models and weights such as Hunyuan3D-2mini, DINOv2 and CLIP. |
